 USD. All are one-time payments.</p></details><details class=\"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none text-lg font-semibold text-white\">Which markets does it support?</summary><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-300\">All three tools track the major Deriv volatility indices, including 1s and standard index variants.</p></details><details class=\"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none text-lg font-semibold text-white\">Is my Deriv account secure?</summary><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-300\">Yes. Access uses Deriv OAuth, which means your sign-in happens through Deriv directly and your password is not stored by Matches Pro.</p></details><details class=\"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none text-lg font-semibold text-white\">Does the tool guarantee wins?</summary><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-300\">No. Trading always carries risk. Matches Pro is designed to help you identify structured opportunities, not eliminate market risk.</p></details><details class=\"rounded-[1.5rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none text-lg font-semibold text-white\">Where can I reach support or the community?</summary><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-300\">Use the official Matches Pro channels on this page. After payment, contact Telegram at t.me/Profitmakertool for confirmation.</p></details></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-white/10 bg-[#0f1514] py-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-4 px-6 text-sm text-slate-400 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between\"><p>© 2026 Matches Pro. Trading carries risk and requires personal judgment.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a href=\"https://t.me/matchespro\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"transition hover:text-[#A87F23]\">Telegram</a><a hr